    "sentence_translations": [
      "(7) Seeing the Little Dog Again",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo was unhappy. She wanted to go to the pet store. She wanted to see those cute cats and dogs.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo was at the pet store. There were a lot of people in the store. They were looking at the cats and dogs.",
      "Little Liang was working. He was very busy.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo was in front of a little dog. Qian Duoduo recognized her!",
      "It’s that dog, the one that Little Liang saw at the school.",
      "The little dog also recognized Qian Duoduo. She was looking at Qian Duoduo.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo smiled and asked, “Do you recognize me?”",
      "",
      "“Last time, I gave you water and something to eat, right? I played with you, right?”",
      "",
      "“Do you have a name now? Are you happy?”",
      "",
      "“I haven’t been too happy in the last two days.",
      "I … I want to see a movie with my mom. I want to have a meal with my mom. Me and Mom, just the two of us.",
      "But … I have a little brother. Mom needs to take care of him, and she can’t go to see a movie with me.”"
    ]
  }
